{"seq":1,"slug":"socialist-theory-evolution","title":"中国特色社会主义理论演进","stage":"DONE","category":"chinese-leadership-synthesis","categoryLabel":"中国领导集体与思想传承","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/07_chinese-leadership-synthesis/1_socialist-theory-evolution","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"中国特色社会主义理论演进-简介\">中国特色社会主义理论演进 简介</h1><p>本知识库以宏观视角系统考察中国特色社会主义理论体系的形成与演进历程，从理论谱系的建立、演进机制的解析到当代综合的前瞻，提供贯通性的学术分析框架。这一理论体系历经数代领导人的接力探索，是马克思主义中国化的重大理论成果，理解其演进逻辑对把握中国政治发展方向具有基础性意义。</p>\n<p>本知识库适合从事中国政治理论研究和比较政治学研究的学者、政治学与马克思主义理论专业学生，以及关注中国道路理论基础的读者。建议阅读前对马克思主义基本原理和中华人民共和国史有系统了解。</p>\n<p>全书共分三章，按照历史谱系、演进机制、当代综合的逻辑结构展开。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>理论谱系</strong>分别考察毛泽东思想奠定的理论基础、邓小平理论实现的历史性突破、江泽民和胡锦涛时期的理论深化发展，建立起清晰的理论演进脉络。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>演进机制</strong>从实践驱动创新、问题导向发展、马克思主义中国化进程三个维度，深入分析理论演进的内在动力和规律性特征。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>当代综合</strong>聚焦新时代的理论整合、理论自信的确立以及未来发展方向，探讨中国特色社会主义理论体系的当代形态和前瞻走向。</p>\n<p>建议读者先通过理论谱系建立历史纵深感，再从演进机制中理解理论发展的内在规律，最后在当代综合中把握理论体系的现实状态和未来走向。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-lineage","title":"理论谱系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/theoretical-lineage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mao-foundation","title":"毛泽东奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/theoretical-lineage/mao-foundation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deng-breakthrough","title":"邓小平突破","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/theoretical-lineage/deng-breakthrough"},{"seq":3,"slug":"jiang-hu-development","title":"江胡发展","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/theoretical-lineage/jiang-hu-development"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"evolution-mechanism","title":"演进机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/evolution-mechanism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"practice-driven-innovation","title":"实践驱动创新","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/evolution-mechanism/practice-driven-innovation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"problem-oriented-development","title":"问题导向发展","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/evolution-mechanism/problem-oriented-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sinification-process","title":"中国化进程","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/evolution-mechanism/sinification-process"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-synthesis","title":"当代综合","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/contemporary-synthesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xi-era-integration","title":"新时代整合","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/contemporary-synthesis/xi-era-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"theoretical-self-confidence","title":"理论自信","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/contemporary-synthesis/theoretical-self-confidence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"future-trajectory","title":"未来走向","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/socialist-theory-evolution/contemporary-synthesis/future-trajectory"}]}]}